===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|back scratcher}}

===Etymology===
From {{compound|en|back|scratcher}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A long [[slender]] [[rod]] with a [[rake]]-like device on one end, sometimes in the form of a [[human]] [[hand]], designed to let a person [[scratch]] their own [[back]].

